--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package implements CBOR Object Signing and Encryption as specified in
RFC 9052 and RFC 9053, together with RFC 9338 (countersignatures), RFC 9360
(X.509 header parameters), RFC 9679 (key thumbprints), RFC 9864
(fully-specified ECDSA algorithms) and RFC 9964 (ML-DSA), and reads the
brainpoolP320r1 domain parameters from RFC 5639.

No third-party code is bundled with this package. Its cryptography is
provided by the separately installed npm dependencies @noble/curves,
@noble/hashes, @noble/ciphers and @noble/post-quantum (MIT licensed), and
its CBOR codec by @vanaheimr/metrological-cbor (Apache-2.0); none of them
is vendored into the published artifact.
